# The OCR language model is provisioned, not committed.
#
# It is 5.2 MB. `LARGE_TRACKED_FILE_BYTES` in packages/director/src/git-truth.ts is set at 1 MiB
# from the experience of exactly this file reaching a commit through a broad `git add` and only
# being caught when a fast-forward refused to overwrite an untracked copy of it.
#
# Provision it with: node packages/local-assistant/scripts/provision-ocr-model.mjs
*.traineddata
